WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.971
The metric Blaschke conjecture.

2
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:05.234
On a sphere, every geodesic stays shortest

3
00:00:05.234 --> 00:00:07.768
until the antipode. Which spaces share this?

4
00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:11.543
Volume comparison forces the model's volume, and

5
00:00:11.543 --> 00:00:13.980
equal volume forces an exact match.

6
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:17.027
Claimed: only the five symmetric families.

7
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:18.844
Not in Lean.
